{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " μίμνω, ἔμιμνον, Poet. redupl. pres. and impf. of μένω; Ep. dat. pl. part. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μιμνόντεσσι Il. 2.296", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; later impf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μίμνασκον Orph. L. 108", "author_abbreviation": "Orph.", "tlg_author": "0579", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": ["Ep."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":— stay, stand fast, in battle, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 13.713", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "15.727", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. tarry, μετόπισθε μιμνέτω, ὥς κε κτλ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "6.69", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. of things, remain, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σόα μ. Od. 13.364", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":— Med. , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κλέος . . μίμνεται ἀθάνατον Epigr.Gr. 265", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (Crete). of things, remain, be left for one, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐμοὶ δὲ μ. σχισμός A. Ag. 1149", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "154", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.). c. acc., await, esp. an enemy's attack, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐδ' ἄρα μιν μίμνον Il. 5.94", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; of time, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἠῶ δῖαν ἔμιμνεν 9.662", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πλόον ὡραῖον Hes. Op. 630", "author_abbreviation": "Hes.", "tlg_author": "0020", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". impers., μίμνει δὲ μίμνοντος ἐν θρόνῳ Διὸς παθεῖν τὸν ἔρξαντα it awaits him to suffer, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ag. 1563", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.). "}]}